  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "As the episode begins, Max philosophizes about life, destiny, and the choices we make, while Chef Viktor Barinov is already busy shouting orders at his suppliers.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Считают, что человек – хозяин судьбы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Мы сами всё решаем.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Мы решаем, с кем нам быть.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Всё зависит только от нас.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Но судьба преподносит нам сюрприз.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Когда мы начинаем в это верить.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Она делает это обычно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Хорошо, Тимур.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Привези мне мясо ягнёнка.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Молодого ягнёнка, а не пенсионера.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Не как вчера.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Вчера было плохое мясо.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's listen to their conversation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Считают, что человек – хозяин судьбы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They say we are masters of our fate.' In his opening voiceover, Max reflects on the old saying that we are masters of our own fate.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Мы сами всё решаем.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We decide everything ourselves.' We like to believe that we make all our own choices in life.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Мы решаем, с кем нам быть.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We decide who we want to be with.' That includes choosing who we want to be with.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Всё зависит только от нас.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everything depends only on us.' At first glance, it feels as if everything depends entirely on us.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Но судьба преподносит нам сюрприз.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'But fate brings us a surprise.' Right when we feel in control, fate likes to throw us a surprise.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Когда мы начинаем в это верить.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When we start believing in this.' Max notes that destiny strikes the moment we start believing we are in charge.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Она делает это обычно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It usually does this.' In fact, life pulls that trick on us all the time.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Хорошо, Тимур.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right, Timur.' Meanwhile outside the kitchen, Barinov wraps up a call with his supplier Timur.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Привези мне мясо ягнёнка.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bring me some lamb meat.' Viktor orders Timur to bring him fresh lamb for today's menu.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Молодого ягнёнка, а не пенсионера.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A young lamb, not a pensioner.' He jokes sharply that he wants a young lamb, not an tough old pensioner.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Не как вчера.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not like yesterday.' He warns Timur not to repeat yesterday's terrible delivery.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Вчера было плохое мясо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yesterday the meat was bad.' Viktor reminds him that yesterday's meat was completely unusable. Now let's hear the whole thing once more.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Считают, что человек – хозяин судьбы.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
